---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
// State A only in the prototype. States B (confirmation screen), C
// (confirmation + reminder emails), and D (panel-full/waitlist) are
// specified in docs/website/sketches/07-book.md and live with the
// scheduler vendor selection (X-03) at launch.
---
<Base title="Book a free conversation — DuBose, M.D.">

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Book a free conversation</h1>

      <div class="book-grid" style="margin-top:34px">
        <div>
          <h3>What to expect</h3>
          <p style="margin-top:12px">
            Thirty minutes, by video. You tell me what&rsquo;s going on — or
            just that you&rsquo;re curious. I&rsquo;ll ask some questions,
            answer yours, and tell you honestly whether I can help.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top:16px">A few things you should know going in:</p>
          <ul class="book-list">
            <li>It&rsquo;s free, and there is no obligation to join.</li>
            <li>If I&rsquo;m not the right fit, I&rsquo;ll say so and point
            you toward someone good.</li>
            <li>No preparation needed. Don&rsquo;t gather records or rehearse
            anything — just come as you are.</li>
            <li>This conversation is not medical care, and nothing about it
            commits you (or me) to anything.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="sched-stub">
            <p style="font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)">[ Embedded scheduler ]</p>
            <p style="margin:14px auto 0;max-width:40ch">
              Step 1: pick a time — business-hours slots, 30 minutes.<br />
              Step 2: name, email, phone, and an optional &ldquo;How did you
              hear about me?&rdquo;
            </p>
            <p style="margin:18px auto 0;max-width:40ch">
              Prototype note: the live scheduler (Cal.com or equivalent) is
              selected and embedded at launch.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="subtext">
            No medical details are needed to book — save those for our
            conversation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="embox">
        <p>
          <strong>Before you book — the one thing that never changes:</strong>
          If you are having an emergency — chest pain, stroke signs, severe
          trouble breathing, thoughts of self-harm — call 911 or go to the
          nearest ER now. This page cannot help you today; the emergency room
          can.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
